  "about": "Named places for address and place search (OP-302). LRT stations are indexed separately from the City's LRT Stations and Stops dataset (fhxi-cnhe), with the aliases below. No coordinate here is typed by hand: scripts/build_search_index.py --write-places fills lat and lng from coord_source.",
