    "parcel_address": "The City of Edmonton Parcel Addresses point (ut27-nrpn) of the place's street address: the mean of its parcel points, or of its suite points where it has no parcel.",
    "lrt_station": "The address is not in Parcel Addresses, so the point is the named LRT station beside the place (fhxi-cnhe, the mean of its platform points). Each such entry's note says how far away it is."
